quest.atmticfq.wheat.desc=
quest.atmticfq.beehive.name=Bee House
quest.atmticfq.beehive.desc=Right click on a beehive with sugar to produce honey.
quest.atmticfq.honey.name=Yummy Bee Food
quest.atmticfq.honey.desc=Honey can be used to craft Wax.
quest.atmticfq.honeyblock.name=Yummy Bee Food Block
quest.atmticfq.honeyblock.desc=It's sticky, you can slide on the side of this block.
quest.atmticfq.wax.name=Wax
quest.atmticfq.wax.desc=Can be crafted into candles.
quest.atmticfq.bowl.name=Wood Bowl
quest.atmticfq.bowl.desc=The base ingredient of many dishes.
quest.atmticfq.mushroomstew.name=Mushroom Stew
quest.atmticfq.mushroomstew.desc=Heals 10 hp.
quest.atmticfq.vegetablestew.name=Vegetable Stew
quest.atmticfq.vegetablestew.desc=Heals 12 hp.
quest.atmticfq.pumpkinstew.name=Pumpkin Stew
quest.atmticfq.pumpkinstew.desc=Heals 20 hp.
quest.atmticfq.cauliflowerstew.name=Cauliflower Cheese Stew
quest.atmticfq.cauliflowerstew.desc=Heals 14 hp.
quest.atmticfq.fruitsalad.name=Fruit Salad
quest.atmticfq.fruitsalad.desc=Heals 16 hp.
quest.atmticfq.dough.name=Dough
quest.atmticfq.dough.desc=Can be crafted into all sort of things such as pizza, cakes and bread.
quest.atmticfq.rawmilk.name=Raw Milk
quest.atmticfq.rawmilk.desc=Obtained by milking the hottest cows in your region
quest.atmticfq.cheese.name=Cheese
quest.atmticfq.cheese.desc=Made by cooking raw milk and heals 4 hp.
quest.atmticfq.pizza.name=Pizza
quest.atmticfq.pizza.desc=Each slices of this pizza heals you 3 hp.
quest.atmticfq.chocolatecake.name=Chocolate Cake
quest.atmticfq.chocolatecake.desc=I'm lying to you when i say that each slices of this cake heals you 3 hp.
quest.atmticfq.egg.name=Egg
quest.atmticfq.egg.desc=What else could I say but “Egg”?
quest.atmticfq.jamjar.name=Jam Jar
quest.atmticfq.jamjar.desc=Heals 8 hp.
quest.atmticfq.coffee.name=Primitive Energy Drink
quest.atmticfq.coffee.desc=Give you speed boost for a brief moment.

chapter.atmticfq.terrapon.name=Terrapon
chapter.atmticfq.terrapon.desc=Craft the armors and the tools of the gods, the best armors you can get.
quest.atmticfq.orbofrogmal.name=Orb of Rogmal
quest.atmticfq.orbofrogmal.desc=A concentrated orb used in many alloy crafts, the base ingredient of all the endgame materials.
quest.atmticfq.reinforcedleather.name=Reinforced Leather
quest.atmticfq.reinforcedleather.desc=A leather made from steel, used in the Hilfintite Armor craft.
quest.atmticfq.obsidianalloy.name=Obsidian Alloy
quest.atmticfq.obsidianalloy.desc=An alloy resistant to really high temperatures, can support the heat of lava stars. Used in the Sollogium Armor and Tools crafts.
quest.atmticfq.glowstonealloy.name=Shiny Alloy
quest.atmticfq.glowstonealloy.desc=It shine like gold, but is useless in this state.
quest.atmticfq.redstonealloy.name=Redstone Alloy
quest.atmticfq.redstonealloy.desc=An alloy made of redstone, used to make Einvadril
quest.atmticfq.lapisalloy.name=Lapis Alloy
quest.atmticfq.lapisalloy.desc=An alloy made of lapis, used to make Hlifintite
quest.atmticfq.balloflava.name=Really hot ball
quest.atmticfq.balloflava.desc=This is what happen when you smelt lava.
quest.atmticfq.lavastar.name=Really hot star
quest.atmticfq.lavastar.desc=You're gonna burn yourself with something this hot in your hands.
quest.atmticfq.hellingot.name=Ingot from your vacations
quest.atmticfq.hellingot.desc=This is what you get from your experiments.
quest.atmticfq.loptfuel.name=Lopt Fuel
quest.atmticfq.loptfuel.desc=A seemingly infinite source of power (it will last 35 hours)
quest.atmticfq.seiarilium.name=Seiarilium
quest.atmticfq.seiarilium.desc=This alloy is primarly used as an Utility material, more info on each stats in the next quests
quest.atmticfq.einvadril.name=Einvadril
quest.atmticfq.einvadril.desc=This alloy is primarly used as an Offensive material, more info on each stats in the next quests
quest.atmticfq.hlifintite.name=Hlifintite
quest.atmticfq.hlifintite.desc=This alloy is primarly used as a Defensive material, more info on each stats in the next quests
quest.atmticfq.sollogium.name=Sollogium
quest.atmticfq.sollogium.desc=This alloy can resist to really high temperatures, more info on each stats in the next quests
quest.atmticfq.redstonealloyrod.name=Redstone Alloy Rod
quest.atmticfq.redstonealloyrod.desc=Used in Hlifintite Tools crafts.u
quest.atmticfq.lapisalloyrod.name=Lapis Alloy Rod
quest.atmticfq.lapisalloyrod.desc=Used in Einvadril Tools crafts.
quest.atmticfq.obsidianalloyrod.name=Obsidian Alloy Rod
quest.atmticfq.obsidianalloyrod.desc=Used in Sollogium Tools crafts.
quest.atmticfq.steelrod.name=Steel Rod
quest.atmticfq.steelrod.desc=Used in Seiarilium Tools crafts.
quest.atmticfq.eilifligronium.name=The Ultimate Alloy
quest.atmticfq.eilifligronium.desc=Made from three powerful alloys, the power of the gods is in your hands.
quest.atmticfq.seialiriumtools.name=Seiarilium Tools
quest.atmticfq.seialiriumtools.desc=As an utility material based tool it's Mining speed is really high but it's Offensive power is the lowest of the three alloys.
quest.atmticfq.seialiriumarmor.name=Seiarilium Armor
quest.atmticfq.seialiriumarmor.desc=As an utility material based armor it's defense is average.
quest.atmticfq.einvadriltools.name=Einvadril Tools
quest.atmticfq.einvadriltools.desc=As an offensive material based tool it's Mining speed is average but it's Offensive power is the highest of the three alloys.
quest.atmticfq.einvadrilarmor.name=Einvadril Armor
quest.atmticfq.einvadrilarmor.desc=As an offensive material based armor it's defense is the lowest of the three alloys.
quest.atmticfq.hlifintitetools.name=Hlifintite Tools
quest.atmticfq.hlifintitetools.desc=As a defensive material based tool it's Mining speed is the lowest of the three alloys but it's Offensive power is average.
quest.atmticfq.hlifintitearmor.name=Hlifintite Armor
quest.atmticfq.hlifintitearmor.desc=As a defensive material based armor it's defense is the highest of the three alloys .
quest.atmticfq.sollogiumtools.name=Sollogium Tools
quest.atmticfq.sollogiumtools.desc=It's not a particularly exceptional tool, it's average in every stats.
quest.atmticfq.sollogiumarmor.name=Sollogium Armor
quest.atmticfq.sollogiumarmor.desc=It's really high temperature resistance is what makes this armor so great, fire resistance is what you'll be granted with the full set equipped.
quest.atmticfq.eilifligroniumtools.name=The Ultimate Tools
quest.atmticfq.eilifligroniumtools.desc=Eilifligronium Tools. Virtually unbreakable, ultra fast. What can't you mine? What can't you kill?
quest.atmticfq.eilifligroniumarmor.name=The Ultimate Armor
quest.atmticfq.eilifligroniumarmor.desc=Eilifligronium Armor. Virtually unbreakable, ultra resistant. What could kill you?
